      "content": "That makes sense. I've heard people talk about \"ghost notes\" or strange, subtle sounds that seem to pop up during certain passages in flute repertoire. Is there a specific mathematical or acoustic reason why those extra, almost \"unseen\" frequencies appear, or is it more about the player's technique?",
